# VIDEO / GAME trig via the author's cyclic isn -> isx/isy components.
#
# Trigonometry Engine equivalence:
#   cos(gamma)=isx(gamma)=1-isn(gamma)
#   sin(gamma)=isy(gamma)=1-isn(gamma-pi/2)
#   tan(gamma)=isy(gamma)/isx(gamma)
